14":"...What are you staring at?\\r","msg_0542_T20_00015":"Lyra: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\rSo you picked...\\n{STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}!\\rThat’s a cute Pokémon you have!\\rWhen you walk with it, it’ll become\\nmore friendly.\\rYou should turn around and talk to it\\nsometimes, too.\\rOh, that’s right!\\nWhy don’t you show it to your mom?\\fSee ya!\\r","msg_0542_T20_00016":"Ethan: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\rSo you picked...\\n{STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}!\\rThat’s a cute Pokémon you have!\\rWhen you walk with it, it’ll become\\nmore friendly.\\rYou should turn around and talk to it\\nsometimes, too.\\rOh, that’s right!\\nWhy don’t you show it to your mom?\\fSee ya!\\r","msg_0542_T20_00017":"Professor Elm: Wait one second!\\r","msg_0542_T20_00018":"I almost completely forgot\\nabout this...\\fHere, I’ll give you my number.\\r","msg_0542_T20_00019":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Professor Elm\\nin the Pokégear!","msg_0542_T20_00020":"Professor Elm: I’ll call you if\\nanything comes up.\\r","msg_0542_T20_00021":"{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}! Where are you going?\\r","msg_0542_T20_00022":"Professor Elm has been waiting for you.\\fHe said he has something to give you.\\r","msg_0542_T20_00023":"Did you not hear me saying that\\nProfessor Elm is waiting for you?\\r","msg_0542_T20_00024":"I’m getting upset!\\r","msg_0542_T20_00025":"Lyra: I wonder what a Kimono Girl\\nwants from you...","msg_0542_T20_00026":"Ethan: I wonder what a Kimono Girl\\nwants from you...","msg_0542_T20_00027":"Lyra: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\r","msg_0542_T20_00028":"Ethan: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\r","msg_0542_T20_00029":"Where do you think you’re going,\\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\\r","msg_0542_T20_00030":"Where do you think you’re going,\\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\\r","msg_0542_T20_00031":"Lyra: Hmm... My Pokémon may be\\nputting on some weight lately...","msg_0542_T20_00032":"Ethan: Hmm... My Pokémon may be\\nputting on some weight lately...","msg_0542_T20_00033":"MARILL: Murfu.\\r","msg_0542_T20_00034":"New Bark Town\\nWinds of a New Beginni